    {
      "name": "2. User Story 1 — ดูรายการ Event",
      "description": "> **User Story 1**: As a user, I can see a list of all events including their **name**, **date**, and how many tickets are currently **available**.\n\nทดสอบว่า GET /events คืนข้อมูลครบตาม User Story",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /events — ครบทุก field ที่ต้องการ",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "",
                  "const events = pm.response.json();",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Response เป็น Array', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(events).to.be.an('array');",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('มีมากกว่า 1 Event (multiple events)', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(events.length).to.be.above(1);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('แต่ละ Event มีครบ: id, name, date, available_tickets', () => {",
                  "  events.forEach(event => {",
                  "    pm.expect(event).to.have.all.keys('id', 'name', 'date', 'available_tickets');",
                  "  });",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('available_tickets เป็นตัวเลข >= 0', () => {",
                  "  events.forEach(event => {",
                  "    pm.expect(event.available_tickets).to.be.a('number').and.at.least(0);",
                  "  });",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('name เป็น string ไม่ว่าง', () => {",
                  "  events.forEach(event => pm.expect(event.name).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('date เป็น string (ISO format)', () => {",
                  "  events.forEach(event => pm.expect(event.date).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/events",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "events"
              ]
            },
            "description": "**User Story 1**: ดูรายการ Event ทั้งหมด\n\nTest ตรวจสอบว่า response มีครบทุก field ที่ User Story กำหนด:\n- `name` — ชื่อ Event\n- `date` — วันที่จัด\n- `available_tickets` — จำนวนตั๋วที่เหลือ (real-time)"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json; charset=utf-8"
                }
              ],
              "cookie": [],
              "body": "[\n  { \"id\": 1, \"name\": \"Coldplay Music of the Spheres World Tour\", \"date\": \"2026-08-21T00:00:00Z\", \"available_tickets\": 100 },\n  { \"id\": 2, \"name\": \"Taylor Swift The Eras Tour\",               \"date\": \"2026-09-21T00:00:00Z\", \"available_tickets\": 50  },\n  { \"id\": 3, \"name\": \"Ed Sheeran +-=÷x Tour\",                    \"date\": \"2026-10-21T00:00:00Z\", \"available_tickets\": 5   }\n]"
