    {
      "name": "3. User Story 2 & 3 — จองตั๋ว (สำเร็จ / ถูกปฏิเสธ)",
      "description": "> **User Story 2**: As a user, I can reserve tickets by providing my **email** and **quantity**.\n> **User Story 3** (Requirement): The system should **reject** a booking if there are not enough tickets remaining.\n\nทดสอบทุก scenario ของการจองตั๋ว",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST booking — [US2] ได้รับคิวการจอง (202)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('[US2] Status 202 Accepted', () => pm.response.to.have.status(202));",
                  "",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('us2_booking_id', json.id);",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('[US2] Response มี field ครบ: id, event_id, email, quantity, status, error_message, created_at', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(json).to.have.all.keys('id', 'event_id', 'email', 'quantity', 'status', 'error_message', 'created_at');",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('[US2] email ใน response ตรงกับที่ส่งไป', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(json.email).to.equal('customer@example.com');",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('[US2] quantity ใน response ตรงกับที่ส่งไป', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(json.quantity).to.equal(2);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('[US2] status ใน response เป็น pending', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(json.status).to.equal('pending');",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('[US2] event_id ตรงกับ event ที่จอง', () => {",
                  "  const eventId = parseInt(pm.collectionVariables.get('event_id'));",
                  "  pm.expect(json.event_id).to.equal(eventId);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
